    "media:imagetext": "TWA AMBASSADOR SERVICE\nFROM HONOLULU TO LOS ANGELES\nFRUIT CUP HALAKAHIKI\nCHARBROILED HAM STEAK\nLean, Tender and Hickory Smoked,\nGrilled Pineapple Garni\nHERB FLAVORED.SCRAMBLED EGGS\nFarm Fresh Eggs blended with spices\nand a dash of Parmesan Cheese...\n*E+#\n27212\nHASH BROWN POTATOES\nLightly seasoned and sauteed to a\nGolden Brown\n****\nCroissant\nPreserves\nCreamery Butter\n*i**\n**7A\n-53-\nJasmine Tea\nCoffee, Freshly Brewed In Flight\nMilk\nTea\n#*\nAL.#\nTWA has pioneered the development of advanced aircraft ovens including microwave units which allows \"cooking in flight.\"\nThis feature enables us to provide you with freshly cooked food in a matter of minutes and assures you more flavorful meals...\nBON APPETIT!\nBC-57\n121",
